    <step order="10" name="Build + test">Run `dotnet build src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane.Core/` — MUST succeed. IF wiring added in Step 7: run `dotnet test src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane.Tests/ --filter "H2aBicepInfraDeployHandler"` — MUST succeed. Re-run `az bicep build infrastructure/bicep/customer.bicep` for final clean compile. If accessible against a test env, run `az deployment sub what-if` for a dry-run proof that the param can be passed end-to-end (preferred but not blocking on env access — `az bicep build` clean is the minimum bar).</step>
